description></item><item><title>调经论篇第六十二</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-62/</link><pubDate>Wed, 02 Apr 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/wuwen-62/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>本文系统阐述了中医虚实补泻的理论基础，详细分析了神、气、血、形、志五类有余不足的临床表现及相应的针刺补泻方法，并深入探讨了阴阳气血失调的病理机制及治疗原则。</description></item></channel></rss>